-- title:
--   Step-17 certified residue list, chunk 13 (2420 residues modulo $2^{27}$)
-- statement:
--   The explicit `List ℕ` of the 2420 residues $r$ with $0\le r<2^{27}=134217728$ that form chunk 13 of 24 of the modulus-$2^{27}$ refinement of the twentyseven-branch Syracuse descent. Each listed residue satisfies $r\equiv 27\pmod{32}$, avoids every earlier exclusion list of the branch, and admits a descent certificate with exponent budget $27$: sixteen exact rows $3b_j+1=2^{a_j}b_{j+1}$ with $b_0=r$, odd $b_{j+1}$ and $\sum_{j<16}a_j\le 27$, followed by a terminal row truncated to the remaining budget whose quotient is below $r$. The list is a published computation, so that the sixteen-step chunk theorem and the refined residual can both refer to it by name instead of repeating 2420 residues in every statement.
-- source:
--   Original computation of this contribution (explicit certified refinement of https://prove2.me/theorems/be7d88ec-edf6-4cd4-aef7-5196be4d9650 from modulus 2^26 to 2^27; the residue table is computed, not quoted from the literature). Method: residue-class descent via the Proved theorem CollatzFrontier.syracuse_terminal_budget_of_descent, https://prove2.me/theorems/2513a4d3-77eb-4b93-9876-33755812122c; exact Syracuse definition https://prove2.me/theorems/2d5fcb43-85b2-4d75-beb8-3e236e66eac3.

